OL,3,ATwo missing as French trawler sinks in
OL,4,AChannel
OL,5,
OL,6,FSearches for two crew members from a
OL,7,FFrench fishing boat which sank in the
OL,8,FEnglish Channel have been suspended
OL,9,Fafter a second day, the Maritime and
OL,10,FCoastguard Agency has said.
OL,12,FA coastguard rescue helicopter,
OL,13,Ffixed-wing plane and RNLI lifeboats
OL,14,Fbegan searching an area south-west of
OL,15,FEddystone Lighthouse off Plymouth,
OL,16,FDevon, after the five-strong crew of
OL,17,Fthe trawler the Maranello made a
OL,18,Fdistress call at 18:00 BST on Saturday.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
