OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ATwo missing as French trawler sinks in
OL,4,AChannel
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe intensive multi-agency search
OL,7,Fcontinued on Sunday before it was
OL,8,F"suspended pending further
OL,9,Finformation", coastguards said at 20:20
OL,10,Fon Sunday.
OL,12,FHM Coastguard said three people rescued
OL,13,Ffrom the boat and taken to hospital
OL,14,Fwere "currently travelling back to
OL,15,FFrance".
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
